{
"id": 13088,
"en": "Bartender",
"ctx": "menú/texto bar0000 + menú/texto bar0001 …"
},
{
"id": 13089,
"en": "A rare Japanese whisky with a robust body.",
"ctx": "menú/texto bar0000 + menú/texto bar0004 …"
},
{
"id": 13090,
"en": "One of the top premium whiskies in Japan and the whole world. A blend of single malts, featuring whiskies aged for 32 years in a Yamazaki white oak barrel, gives it distinct character.",
"ctx": "menú/texto bar0000 + menú/texto bar0004 …"
},
{
"id": 13091,
"en": "Its quality has earned it a grand prize in an international competition. Only about 2,000 bottles are produced each year, making it especially rare. ",
"ctx": "menú/texto bar0000 + menú/texto bar0004 …"
},
{
"id": 13092,
"en": "If you really like whisky, this is the bottle you have to experience.",
"ctx": "menú/texto bar0000 + menú/texto bar0006"
},
{
"id": 13093,
"en": "A single malt whisky aged in sherry barrels for a balanced flavor.",
"ctx": "menú/texto bar0000 + menú/texto bar0002 …"
},
{
"id": 13094,
"en": "This limited edition Yamazaki was created in 1999 to commemorate Suntory's 100 year anniversary. A long aging process in sherry wood barrels produces a perfect balance.",
"ctx": "menú/texto bar0000 + menú/texto bar0002 …"
},
{
"id": 13095,
"en": "I'm certain anyone fortunate enough to enjoy this rare whisky will experience pure bliss. Its price puts it just within reach, as far as dream whiskies go. ",
"ctx": "menú/texto bar0000 + menú/texto bar0002 …"
},
{
"id": 13096,
"en": "I enjoy drinking it on special occasions.",
"ctx": "menú/texto bar0000 + menú/texto bar0002 …"
},
{
"id": 13097,
"en": "A Yamazaki whisky made with carefully selected, mature malts for a flavorful, smooth finish.",
"ctx": "menú/texto bar0000 + menú/texto bar0002 …"
},
{
"id": 13098,
"en": "This is one of Japan's top single malt whiskies. It's become such a status symbol that whisky aficionados the world over have heard of it. ",
"ctx": "menú/texto bar0000 + menú/texto bar0002 …"
},
{
"id": 13099,
"en": "They use carefully selected, perfectly matured single malts to get that great, smooth flavor. It's popular overseas, too.",
"ctx": "menú/texto bar0000 + menú/texto bar0002 …"
},
{
"id": 13100,
"en": "This one's made at Suntory's Hakushu distillery in Japan's South Alps, an area famous for its mountain spring water.",
"ctx": "menú/texto bar0000 + menú/texto bar0004 …"
},
{
"id": 13101,
"en": "Its fruity, creamy flavor combined with a distinctly smoky accent makes for a superb drinking experience. ",
"ctx": "menú/texto bar0000 + menú/texto bar0004 …"
},
{
"id": 13102,
"en": "I recommend taking the first drink straight up, to fully appreciate its quality.",
"ctx": "menú/texto bar0000 + menú/texto bar0004 …"
},
{
"id": 13103,
"en": "Another extremely popular Japanese whisky. Malt whisky aged in sherry barrels at the Yamazaki Distillery are blended with carefully selected malt and grain whiskies.",
"ctx": "menú/texto bar0000 + menú/texto bar0002 …"
},
{
"id": 13104,
"en": "It has a bright aroma and delivers a sweet fullness in the mouth, and the finish is deep and mellow. ",
"ctx": "menú/texto bar0000 + menú/texto bar0002 …"
},
{
"id": 13105,
"en": "A lot of people call it Daruma, because the round shape of its bottle looks like a Daruma doll.",
"ctx": "menú/texto bar0000 + menú/texto bar0002 …"
},
{
"id": 13106,
"en": "By the way, The Macallan has a brand new product called Fine Oak, which is a blend of single malts aged in bourbon and sherry barrels.",
"ctx": "menú/texto bar0000 + menú/texto bar0002 …"
},
{
"id": 13107,
"en": "But this one here was aged entirely in sherry barrels, using the traditional Macallan production method.",
"ctx": "menú/texto bar0000 + menú/texto bar0002 …"
},
{
"id": 13108,
"en": "The 30 year aging process produces a rich sherry note and a deep sweetness like ripe fruit. There's none of the wood taste of over aging.",
"ctx": "menú/texto bar0000 + menú/texto bar0002 …"
},
{
"id": 13109,
"en": "This one's incredibly smooth and it has a freshness you wouldn't expect from a 30 year old whisky. It may be pricey, but one sip and you'll know that it's well worth it.",
"ctx": "menú/texto bar0000 + menú/texto bar0002 …"
}
]